         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The number zero\n\nToday, when we talk about a number that shows what we do not have, or emptiness, we use zero (0). But it was not always like this. It may seem strange, but for a long time this idea did not exist.\n\nIn this lesson, we will study how this knowledge grew. We will also study why we needed a number to show what we do not have.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
