               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Intuitive\n\nThis is the most common type of zero. Even ancient peoples knew about it, and they never made a symbol for it.\n\nFor example, if we lower all the fingers of the hand, no finger is raised. So we have zero (0) raised fingers.\n\nThis intuitive zero does not need a symbol to be written. The most important thing here is the idea.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
