      {
         "id": "03808fad-6362-4083-aef5-76d8e86e5f8b",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "Since zero (0) is a number that represents \"not having something\", should it be the first of the numbers?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "9f4db07e-429e-4f56-b004-2620e34296a4",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2
      },
      {
         "id": "9f4db07e-429e-4f56-b004-2620e34296a4",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "party",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we learned about the number zero. We saw that there is more than one type of zero. We also saw that the idea of zero existed before different peoples made a symbol for it.\n\nWe also saw that zero has the idea of \"not having something\". So it will be the first number we use.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
